qembian hooks in the Khronos OpenVG RI (src/khr, docs/devices/nokia-n8-rm596/vg-host.md): window and
pbuffer drawables get a host GPU surface; clears of them and reads from them go to the host;
the rasteriser may read the pixel pipe. Applied by src/khr/build.sh to its copy of the RI.

